<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Lava Flow</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 11)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast lava flow &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast lava flow</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The first of the dark knight's fires: a flow of molten rock pours over the 
target. The better your power and fire sphere, the more it burns. It does 
most against plate and chain, which hold the heat, and least against clothes. 
A shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls. Stronger fires follow: hellfire, brimstone and soulfire.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hellfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Brimstone</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Soulfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>